  "prefLabel": "Pda 101.30 Shore facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.30 “Shore facility” means all landside property owned or operated by the authority in the vicinity of the Barker and Burge wharves, including, but not limited to, roadways, access ways, parking lots, buildings and other structures, boat ramps, equipment, and utilities.\n\nSource. #8760, eff 11-18-06",
